{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Technological Dependence.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Technological Dependence.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"technological dependence technological dependence","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Technological Dependence.md","fileName":"Technological Dependence.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Technological Dependence","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Data Ethics and Digital Power]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Technological Dependence.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Technological Dependence.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"technological dependence technological dependence","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Technological Dependence.md","fileName":"Technological Dependence.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Technological Dependence","heading":"Technological Dependence","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Technological dependence occurs when ordinary life, institutions, or critical services become difficult to maintain without a technical system. Dependence can create convenience and capability while converting the system's weaknesses into human vulnerabilities.\n\nWith AI, dependence may reduce the knowledge and practical ability needed to check or replace automated judgments. It also increases the consequences of error, attack, or loss of access. Ethical deployment therefore considers fallback procedures, human competence, and resilience rather than measuring only normal performance. A system that works efficiently but leaves no safe alternative can make its users less autonomous.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Technological Dependence.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Technological Dependence.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"technological dependence technological dependence","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Technological Dependence.md","fileName":"Technological Dependence.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Technological Dependence","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}